      "content": "it's just that everything feels so heavy. like i'm just a ghost walking through a graveyard of stuff that used to mean something. you talk about letting go like it's this beautiful thing, but it feels so final. do you really think there's any actual peace in just... stopping? or is it just a way to avoid the mess?",
